menu "GSM Driver Configuration"

    config GSM_PHONE_NUMBER
        string "Phone number for SMS notifications"
        default "+201001234567"
        help
            The phone number (in E.164 format) where the GSM module
            sends boot-time SMS alerts.

    config GSM_FORCE_HTTP
        bool "Force HTTP (disable SSL detection)"
        default n
        help
            Some SIM800 modules falsely report SSL support but fail
            on actual TLS handshakes. Enable this to skip the SSL
            detection and always use plain HTTP.

endmenu
